<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Viking Office said a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Viking Office said a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber initiated coverage of Viking Office Products Inc as a buy, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 5/8 to 29-1/2 in early Nasdaq trade.</p>
